>Anyone care to suggest some basic beginner's strategy? I seem to
>wander aimlessly, killing small-time monsters but getting no
>interesting artifacts of any kind. I am in frequent danger of starving
>(despite eating every corpse I come across), and never have enough
>money to buy anything significant from the shopkeepers (incidentally,
>I thought it was extremely unfriendly of one to charge me for the
